WEBVTT

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:04.515
Guide 8. Check your workbook really saved on
the laptop.

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:09.525
You've made your changes. Before we move on,
let's check that you can find them again.

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:11.505
First, confirm your last edit. Now check the
workbook name and location.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:17.675
Check the file name. Make sure this is your
own named copy in school OneDrive.

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:27.145
Wait until Excel has finished saving. If
your version shows a Save button, use it and
check that saving completes.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:32.495
Don't close the workbook while it is still
saving or showing an error. Raise your hand
if saving isn't working.

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:38.690
Now I'll close the workbook and reopen the
same named file from my school OneDrive.

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:42.635
I'm not opening the original starter. I'll
check the four changes.

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:48.655
B2 should show 28 cups. B7 should show my
chosen activity.

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:53.415
B8 should show 28 students. And C4

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:57.085
should show 4 for the cost of each poster.

00:00:57.100 --> 00:01:01.365
The number of posters in B4 should still be
2, and the budget in B9 should still be 120.

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:09.265
Now it's your turn. Reopen your workbook and
check that your changes are still there.

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:11.945
When you've checked it, return to the lesson
web page and select I reopened and checked
it.

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:15.545
If anything is missing, keep the file open
and ask me for help.
